  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Z.170 defines a documentation of Testing and Test Control Notation 3 (TTCN-3) source code using special documentation comments. The source code documentation can then be produced automatically from the TTCN-3 core language, e.g., in the form of hypertext web pages.This revision of the Recommendation contains amendments, clarifications, corrigenda and editorial corrections.</abstract>
